\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces SDF effect attenuates dramatically when arm-body collisions dominate. On \texttt  {spatial\_bowl}, EE-only SDF provides only +5\,pp CAR (vs.\ +25\,pp on \texttt  {object\_pudding}), confirming the structural limitation of end-effector-only geometric supervision.}}{4}{table.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:cross_scene}{{8}{4}{SDF effect attenuates dramatically when arm-body collisions dominate. On \texttt {spatial\_bowl}, EE-only SDF provides only +5\,pp CAR (vs.\ +25\,pp on \texttt {object\_pudding}), confirming the structural limitation of end-effector-only geometric supervision}{table.8}{}}
